+      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: one new transparent 2D game sprite HEAD ONLY for Mender-bloom, a healing flower in a 2009 Plants vs. Zombies-style lawn game. Image1 is a STYLE REFERENCE ONLY: match the original game's matte modeled color, bold slightly irregular dark brown outlines, restrained warm highlights, hand-painted cartoon shading, simple expressive face, and readable chunky organic forms. Image2 is a STEM/LEAF STYLE AND ATTACHMENT REFERENCE ONLY; do NOT include or redraw those leaves or stem. The delivered image must contain just a new flower head with a short narrow base ready to attach to that original stem.\nCreate a DISTINCTIVE UPRIGHT CUP-SHAPED CORAL BLOSSOM: three large fleshy overlapping petals make a rounded tulip-like cup, a broad upper half with two off-center notches and uneven rounded petal tips, tapering into a narrow bottom neck. The front petal folds diagonally over a darker side petal, creating a strong asymmetrical curved silhouette and clear layered painted depth. One outer petal tip leans gently outward. The little face is ON THE CORAL FRONT PETAL itself, not on a separate disk: two small uneven dark oval eyes, a slight caring lopsided smile, a tiny relaxed brow; expression quietly attentive and capable. Petal colors are muted warm coral/salmon with dusky rose shadows and small soft peach highlights. The head is three-quarter facing slightly right, with a narrow dark green sepal collar only at the very bottom. Strong original-game-style light/dark modeling and confident readable outlines; make it look like a real in-game plant sprite at 55 pixels high.\nCRITICAL IDENTITY CONSTRAINTS: no Sunflower face, no brown center disk, no circular yellow/cream face, no radial petal ring, no six-petal star, no daisy or sunflower shape, no muzzle, no medical props, no badges/crosses/symbols or bandages, no hands. This must read as a cupped blossom with a face on its petal, unlike Sunflower. No glossy plastic, 3D render, vector-flat look, excessive shine, brush texture noise, or anime/kawaii eyes. No ground, no shadow, no stem or leaves, no labels, no surrounding scene. Genuinely transparent background. One isolated head, centered with generous transparent padding around every edge, all petals visible, no clipping.",
+      "sha256": "248ec8817f77b869478ac8a351ca78c6a6926d57673d5a7f35f8861df823b89e",
