+        "head-master.png"
+      ],
+      "transparentBackground": true,
+      "prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. This image is Mender-bloom's FINAL CORAL CUPPED BLOSSOM HEAD, the edit target. Make its blink expression. Change ONLY the two small dark oval eyes into relaxed narrow curved closed-eyelid strokes at the exact same eye positions. Keep the caring eyebrows and the small lopsided smile exactly unchanged. Preserve every other pixel feature: same exact canvas, position, transparent alpha, cup silhouette, all overlapping petal folds and tips/notches, proportions, facing direction, green sepal collar, colors, matte smooth shading, outlines and highlights. No new expression changes elsewhere, no new marks, no glow, props, leaves, stem, background or shadow. The closed image will supply ONLY the two eye-region RGB areas to an otherwise unchanged registered animation frame. Genuine transparency, identical framing.",
